5. EXTERNAL RUNTIME DEPENDENCY NOT VENDORED
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  The simulation world includes a model fetched from Gazebo Fuel:

    https://fuel.gazebosim.org/1.0/OpenRobotics/models/Sun

  Gazebo caches Fuel models after their first download, so this requires network
  access once. It is an Open Robotics model under its own licence and is not
  redistributed here.
